          "\"Jamais\" in the past is how French says I'd never: \"Je n'avais jamais vu la mer\" (I had never seen the sea). Watch the article: after the negation \"un\", \"une\", \"des\" become \"de\": \"Je n'avais jamais fait de ski.\"",
